{"entryId":"3227","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:3227:1","sourceSha256":"dcb17f4007f2bc959ba849c992ea17cffb69ea2afa4ced5650b049325fb04e76","englishSha256":"49f5da909fa503f09d83193d07918708466337dc9669614558f5660bcdd57822","citations":[{"id":"3227:1:link-001","he":[0,33],"en":[0,39],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pesachim_39a.11"},"reference":"Pesachim 39a:11","assessment":"Rav Rehumi asks Abaye about the kind of plant eligible for maror.","evidence":[{"reference":"Pesachim 39a:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pesachim_39a.11"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3227:1:link-002","he":[35,67],"en":[40,74],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Nazir_13a.9"},"reference":"Nazir 13a:9","assessment":"The passage calls the questioner Ben Rehumi. His relationship to the bearer of the entry heading is open.","evidence":[{"reference":"Nazir 13a:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Nazir_13a.9"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3227:1:link-003","he":[69,130],"en":[75,150],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zevachim_77a.5"},"reference":"Zevachim 77a:5","assessment":"The named speaker and source of the teaching are explicit.","evidence":[{"reference":"Zevachim 77a:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zevachim_77a.5"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3227:1:link-004","he":[132,224],"en":[211,217],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rosh_on_Eruvin_1.19.1"},"reference":"Rosh on Eruvin 1:19:1","assessment":"The checked Eruvin brackets bar Shilat. The checked Rosh text includes the spelling bar Shila in its running text.","evidence":[{"reference":"Rosh on Eruvin 1:19:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rosh_on_Eruvin_1.19.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Eruvin 14b:18","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_14b.18"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3227