Ketubot 62b:4","assessment":"Ketubbot makes attendance before Rava a habitual practice. It specifies a roof that collapsed. Heilprin’s introduction and step wording remain visible.","evidence":[{"reference":"Ketubot 62b:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_62b.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3227:1:link-010","he":[635,665],"en":[1010,1052],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Chullin_89a.14"},"reference":"Chullin 89a:14","assessment":"Rav Rehumi challenges Ravina’s teaching about a shofar used in idolatry.","evidence":[{"reference":"Chullin 89a:14","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Chullin_89a.14"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3227:1:link-011","he":[667,695],"en":[1053,1078],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yoma_78a.4"},"reference":"Yoma 78a:4","assessment":"Rav Rihumi reports seeing Ravina cross while wearing the footwear.","evidence":[{"reference":"Yoma 78a:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yoma_78a.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3227:1:link-012","he":[697,755],"en":[1083,1100],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Seder_HaDorot%2C_Almanac_4203.2"},"reference":"Seder HaDorot, Almanac 4203:2","assessment":"Almanac 4203:2 explicitly records the thirteen-year headship from 4203 to 4216. Its identity connection to the earlier narrative remains Heilprin’s attribution.","evidence":[{"reference":"Seder HaDorot, Almanac 4203:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Seder_HaDorot%2C_Almanac_4203.2"},"witness":"Warsaw, 1878-1882"}]},{"id":"3227:1:link-013","he":[756,804],"en":[1195,1251],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Menachot_33b.8"},"reference":"Menachot 33b:8","assessment":"The explicit gloss’s Menahot reading agrees with the checked text.","evidence":[{"reference":"Menachot 33b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Menachot_33b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3227:1:link-014","he":[826,876],"en":[1337,1417],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_11a.12"},"reference":"Eruvin 11a:12","assessment":"Eruvin directly has the two names given here. Preserve the gloss’s express reservation.","evidence":[{"reference":"Eruvin 11a:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_11a.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,1,2,3,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12,13],"holds":[{"raw":"שהי' ראש ישיבה בפומבדיתא י\"ג שנים","reason":"The Almanac supports the headship report. Whether it refers to the Rav Rehumi in the account before Rava remains an identity and chronology hold.","evidence":[{"reference":"Seder HaDorot, Almanac 4203:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Seder_HaDorot%2C_Almanac_4203.2"},"witness":"Warsaw, 1878-1882"},{"reference":"Ketubot 62b:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_62b.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"raw":"ובשס\"ח רבה רחומי ט\"ס","reason":"The known Menahot witness has Rav Rihumi. The precise edition of the gloss’s Rabbah reading remains open.","evidence":[{"reference":"Menachot 33b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Menachot_33b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"The Eruvin and Rif witnesses have Rav Yosef while Menahot has Abba Yosi. The Almanac cross-reference confirms what Heilprin records about the academy, leaving the identity question open. The Ketubbot narrative specifies a roof and describes regular attendance before Rava. The siglum and its edition remain unresolved.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Rif Menachot 5b:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rif_Menachot_5b.5"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Menachot 33b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Menachot_33b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 62b:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_62b.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot, Almanac 4203:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Seder_HaDorot%2C_Almanac_4203.2"},"witness":"Warsaw, 1878-1882"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
